  {
   "title": "Révision espacée",
   "html": "<p>Dis à voix haute, sans regarder la réponse :</p><ol><li>petit <small class=\"muted\">(leçon 35)</small></li><li>film <small class=\"muted\">(leçon 33)</small></li><li>minute <small class=\"muted\">(leçon 29)</small></li><li>baisser (le prix) <small class=\"muted\">(leçon 22)</small></li></ol><details><summary>Réponses</summary><ol><li><span class=\"lo\">ນ້ອຍ</span> <span class=\"rom\">Nɔ̏ɔy</span> · petit</li><li><span class=\"lo\">ໜັງ</span> <span class=\"rom\">Nǎng</span> · film</li><li><span class=\"lo\">ນາທີ</span> <span class=\"rom\">Náa-thíi</span> · minute</li><li><span class=\"lo\">ຫຼຸດ</span> <span class=\"rom\">Lūt</span> · baisser (le prix)</li></ol></details>"
